  "body": "Whether you're stepping onto the property ladder, downsizing or adding to your investment portfolio, this well maintained, spacious two-bedroom unit is well worth a look.\r\n \r\nThis hidden Gem was built in the 1970s on a cross lease title and is the back unit (1 of 2). Constructed of solid concrete block with a tile roof and fully refurbished five years ago, it combines enduring appeal with everyday comfort. A spacious lounge and dining area provides room to relax, complemented by a fully fitted kitchen and a mix of wood laminate and carpet flooring.\r\n \r\nGreat indoor/outdoor living to the large, sunny, fully enclosed rear garden offers a private spot to entertain, potter or simply unwind. Covered parking beside the front door and a handy garden shed add to the convenience.\r\n \r\nSet on Marina Road, on the main bus route and within walking distance of shops, parks and beaches, this is easy living in a location that puts everything within reach.\r\n\r\nAvailable with vacant possession - make your move today.\r\n\r\nProperty Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/W3CY\r\n\r\nViewings By Appointment & As Advertised\r\n\r\nPhotography Disclosure: Selected images have been digitally enhanced using AI to remove personal belongings and household clutter for presentation purposes. The property is currently occupied and may differ in appearance from the photographs shown. Buyers are encouraged to view the property in person.",
